  projectName: Quick Bio
  description: "I am Thomas, a game developer with a background in sound design and
    academic research, based near Copenhagen. I work primarily with Unity and have
    experience developing interactive applications across 2D, 3D, VR, mobile, and
    web platforms. My approach emphasizes clean, maintainable C# code, structured
    playtesting, and reliable project management.\n\nI completed my Master\u2019s
    degree in Game Design at IT University of Copenhagen in 2024. I am currently
    open to new opportunities and collaborations and welcome conversations about
    potential projects or roles."
